@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 创建任务 - 成功案例
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task_name": "上海电力巡检",
    "task_type": "电力",
    "latitude": 31.23,
    "longitude": 121.47
}

### 2. 创建任务 - 失败：纬度超出中国范围
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task_name": "海外非法任务",
    "task_type": "测绘",
    "latitude": 1.0, 
    "longitude": 121.47
}

### 3. 创建任务 - 失败：命中禁飞区 (北京周边 39-41, 115-117)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task_name": "故宫周边探测",
    "task_type": "敏感任务",
    "latitude": 40.0,
    "longitude": 116.40
}

### 4. 创建任务 - 失败：JSON 格式错误
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "task_name": "格式错误",
    "latitude": "应该是非数字"
}


### 5. ROI 设置 - 成功案例
POST {{baseUrl}}/rois
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roi_name": "华东监测区",
    "min_lat": 30.0,
    "max_lat": 32.0,
    "min_long": 120.0,
    "max_long": 122.0
}

### 6. ROI 设置 - 失败：纬度区间逻辑错误 (Min > Max)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rois
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roi_name": "反向纬度区",
    "min_lat": 40.0,
    "max_lat": 30.0,
    "min_long": 120.0,
    "max_long": 122.0
}

### 7. ROI 设置 - 失败：经度区间逻辑错误 (Min > Max)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rois
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roi_name": "反向经度区",
    "min_lat": 30.0,
    "max_lat": 32.0,
    "min_long": 120.0,
    "max_long": 110.0
}

### 8. ROI 设置 - 失败：名称太短
POST {{baseUrl}}/rois
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roi_name": "A",
    "min_lat": 30.0,
    "max_lat": 32.0,
    "min_long": 110.0,
    "max_long": 120.0
}